      "sourceTextSha256": "7ea1f4c2775048ea48552c4e32dc428945dbf4a5e0025d359a7f3ab4086422c2",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
        "fileId": "1IJ-ifZl_wfTwk-xMrqNJcO6OBMQunbcA",
        "documentSha256": "e72781a19f85cef319201422e08f82b1f3826c037805c98f97b2081b4eed559c",
        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "ref": "word/document.xml#p0018",
            "textSha256": "09765b0adbac501c7a41e3d062fa702df63399a8645d9f54bde01b56085e7c7d"
          },
          {
            "ref": "word/document.xml#p0019",
            "textSha256": "da470b53485abb74817c3e3360513becf95ddce431981250a2a8c73f02ac3b6f"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Enjoy your breakfast. Once in Ica, head to the Huacachina Oasis, a stunning desert lagoon surrounded by towering dunes. Here, you’ll enjoy an adrenaline-filled buggy ride through the dunes, followed by an exciting sandboarding session, where you can glide down the vast desert sands. Known as \"The Oasis of America,\" Huacachina offers a unique escape, where visitors can experience thrilling sandboarding, dune buggy rides, and explore the vast desert, making it a must-visit destination for adventure and nature lovers.\n\nIn the evening, take a bus to Nazca, known for the famous Nazca Lines, with mysterious geoglyphs etched into the desert floor. Overnight in Nazca."
    },
